接：网页链接&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/c99b4f518ee8f94233b61c11035bc92e24781386.png" width="1242" height="1660" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/392cd760e60011865be6e8d763def43024781386.png" width="1242" height="1660" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/d40a1a2a067461c14fd88862db083b2524781386.png" width="1242" height="1660" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;图文地址：&lt;a href="https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1173694586411810825"&gt;https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1173694586411810825&lt;/a&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1173694586411810825</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1173694586411810825</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Feb 2026 12:54:26 GMT</pubDate><author>心理学韩卓</author></item><item><title>AI商才是未来决定一个人是否有竞争力的关键</title><description>AI商才是未来决定一个人是否有竞争力的关键&lt;br&gt;未来拉开人和人差距的并不只是智商、情商，还有AI商&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/6278f35942b11daef7a462d6d7802c49082a1781.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;视频地址：&lt;a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bWZLBNEjg"&gt;https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bWZLBNEjg&lt;/a&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bWZLBNEjg</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bWZLBNEjg</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Feb 2026 10:30:03 GMT</pubDate><author>心理学韩卓</author><category>AIGC人工智能</category></item><item><title>情绪稳定并不是压抑情绪</title><description>情绪稳定并不是压抑情绪&lt;br&gt;情绪稳定并不是压抑你的情绪，而是以非破坏性的方式表达你的情绪。&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/acac3498ff73c3e0aab42655e4e476861a51d071.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;视频地址：&lt;a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VdZLBVE5h"&gt;https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VdZLBVE5h&lt;/a&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VdZLBVE5h</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VdZLBVE5h</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Feb 2026 10:00